      "section_no": null,
      "title": "Power to create new Districts",
      "text": "It shall be lawful for the 2 [***] Government, by notification in the official Gazette, to create new districts in any part of Bangladesh. 3 [Government may, from time to time, alter the limits of the existing districts in any part of Bangladesh]."
